---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../config"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../img/do.gif';
---
<Layout title="About" description={site.description}>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div class="description">
            <p>
                Derek Olson is a software designer and developer who thrives in the spaces between creativity and technology.
                He aims to fuse art and design with electronics, code, sensors, wires, 
                and solder.
            </p>
            <p>
                Over the last fifteen years, Derek has been recruited to produce work for outstanding 
                studios and consultancies - most recently spending nearly a decade as a software design lead at 
                <a href="https://www.ideo.com/">IDEO</a>, helping dream up and prototype new 
                products and experiences for companies around the world. 
                In his downtime, he aspires to create magic by joining forces with artists, 
                designers, and developers throughout the country.
            </p>
            <p>
                You can find Derek elsewhere on the web: 
                browse his open-source code on <a href="https://github.com/derekolson">Github</a>, 
                and connect with him on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/derekmolson">LinkedIn.</a>
            </p>
            <p>
                Derek is always on the lookout for new challenges and collaborations.
                Please feel free to reach out at <span id="obf"></span>
            </p>

        </div>
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Portrait of Derek Olson" style="overflow: hidden; border-radius: 50%; max-width: 400px; margin: auto;"/>
    </div>

    <script>document.getElementById("obf")!.innerHTML=atob("PmEvPG1vYy5vLWtlcmVkQG9sbGVoPiJtb2Muby1rZXJlZEBvbGxlaDpvdGxpYW0iPWZlcmggYTw=").split("").reverse().join("");</script>
</Layout>
